OL,3,AUS strikes on alleged drug boats could
OL,4,Abe crimes against humanity, says UN
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UN report has concluded that recent
OL,7,FUS airstrikes on vessels allegedly
OL,8,Ftrafficking drugs breached
OL,9,Finternational law and could constitute
OL,10,Fcrimes against humanity.
OL,12,FThe report by Special Rapporteur Ben
OL,13,FSaul said since September last year
OL,14,Fthere had been at least 68 US strikes
OL,15,Fin the Caribbean and Pacific, outside
OL,16,FUS territorial waters, which killed
OL,17,Fmore than 220 people.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
