OL,3,AUS strikes on alleged drug boats could
OL,4,Abe crimes against humanity, says UN
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaul said that even if targets could be
OL,7,Fidentified as members of designated
OL,8,Fterrorist groups, they had not staged
OL,9,Fan armed attack on the US which would
OL,10,Ftrigger a right to self-defence under
OL,11,Finternational law.
OL,13,FThe report comes two days after the US
OL,14,Fmilitary said it killed four people in
OL,15,Fa strike on a vessel in the Caribbean.
